Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 12:51:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] Fix candle timeouts and backend unresponsiveness by
 isolating REST concurrency - Split OHLCV fetching into dedicated background
 (low priority) and interactive (high priority) semaphore pools to prevent
 queue blocking - Implement chunked, paused OHLCV loops for hot symbols to
 avoid flooding exchange rate limits during focus mode rotation - Add
 fresh-candle reuse logic in fetch_candles to serve charts from STORE without
 hitting API when data is valid - Introduce separate high-concurrency
 semaphore for focus-mode volatility calculations to speed up initial
 selection

---
 crypto-screener/app/collector.py | 78 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 70 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/crypto-screener/app/collector.py b/crypto-screener/app/collector.py
index 5659519..9c79a2e 100644
